data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Wait, the screenshot shows the greeting in sky blue, not teal. But my verification script said default colour was teal rgb(79, 179, 166). Hmm, but the screenshot was taken after the script clicked all buttons, so the final colour is sky. The script output shows after clicking Sky it became rgb(106, 176, 212). That's what we see in the screenshot. So the default was teal, and after clicking all buttons it ended on sky. Good.\n\nActually wait - the screenshot was taken at the end of the script after clicking all buttons. So it shows sky. That's fine.\n\nNow I need to push to qa and dispatch verification. My branch currently has the merged developer work. I need to push my HEAD to qa at refs/campaign/orchestrator."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789849347,"id":"chatcmpl-d16e828a4e3945608cb606f93404f758","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

